  "title": "S.Amdt. 719 to S. 649 (113th Congress): Constitutional Concealed Carry Reciprocity Act of 2013",
  "urls": [
    "https://web.archive.org/web/2024/https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1131/vote_113_1_00100.htm",
